---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Logo from "../components/Logo.astro";
import Icon from "@cloudflare/nimbus-docs/components/Icon.astro";
import { SearchTrigger } from "../components/ui/search";
import { ThemeToggle } from "../components/ui/theme-toggle";
import { Aside } from "../components/ui/aside";
import { Step, Steps } from "../components/ui/steps";
import { TabItem, Tabs } from "../components/ui/tabs";
import { PackageManagers } from "../components/ui/package-managers";

const command = "bun create @cloudflare/nimbus-docs@latest my-docs --yes";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="面向文档的写作工具"
  description="Nimbus 是面向文档的写作工具：写一次，自动检查、评审，并发布为面向人与智能体的 HTML 与 Markdown。"
>
  <div class="lp-page">
    <header class="lp-header">
      <div class="lp-container lp-header-inner">
        <a class="lp-brand" href="/" aria-label="Nimbus 首页">
          <Logo class="h-6 w-10 shrink-0" />
          <span class="lp-brand-name">Nimbus</span>
        </a>

        <nav class="lp-nav" aria-label="主导航">
          <a href="/quickstart/">文档</a>
          <a href="/components/">组件</a>
          <a href="/registry/">注册表</a>
          <a href="/why-nimbus/">理念</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="lp-actions">
          <SearchTrigger />
          <ThemeToggle />
          <a class="lp-icon-link" href="https://github.com/bbylw/nimbus-cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="GitHub">
            <Icon name="ph:github-logo" class="h-4 w-4" />
          </a>
          <a class="lp-cta" href="/quickstart/">
            <span>开始使用</span>
            <Icon name="ph:arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="lp-mobile-nav" aria-label="移动端导航">
        <a href="/quickstart/">文档</a>
        <a href="/components/">组件</a>
        <a href="/registry/">注册表</a>
        <a href="/why-nimbus/">理念</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="lp-hero">
        <div class="lp-container">
          <div class="lp-eyebrow">
            <span class="lp-avatars" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="lp-avatar lp-avatar-you">你</span>
              <span class="lp-avatar lp-avatar-agent">AI</span>
              <span class="lp-avatar lp-avatar-review">审</span>
            </span>
            <span>你、一个智能体、一位评审正在编辑</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="lp-title">
            <span class="lp-title-line">
              认识
              <span class="lp-title-strong">
                Nimbus
                <span class="lp-tag lp-tag-agent">智能体</span>
              </span>
            </span>
            <span class="lp-title-line lp-title-muted">
              面向文档的
              <span class="lp-select">
                写作工具
                <span class="lp-tag lp-tag-you">你</span>
              </span>
            </span>
          </h1>

          <p class="lp-lede">
            和你的团队一起写作，也和你的智能体一起。<br />
            每一页都达到你的标准。
          </p>

          <div class="lp-command" data-copy-command data-copy-value={command}>
            <span class="lp-command-prefix">$</span>
            <code class="lp-command-text">{command}</code>
            <button class="lp-command-copy" type="button" data-copy-trigger aria-label="复制安装命令">
              <Icon name="ph:copy" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
              <span data-copy-label>复制</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <p class="lp-note">需要 Node.js 22.12+ · MIT 许可 · 你的仓库，你的文件</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lp-section lp-pipeline">
        <div class="lp-container">
          <div class="lp-section-head">
            <p class="lp-kicker">写一次，走完整个流程</p>
            <h2 class="lp-h2">
              你写一次。Nimbus <em>检查</em>它，留住它等待评审，然后把它发布给人和智能体。
            </h2>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-workbench">
            <div class="lp-wb-bar">
              <span class="lp-wb-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span class="lp-wb-url">my-docs / alerts.mdx</span>
              <span class="lp-wb-pill">预览</span>
            </div>

            <div class="lp-wb-grid">
              <article class="lp-stage lp-stage-checks">
                <p class="lp-stage-label">01 / 检查</p>
                <h3>每一页都通过同一套检查。</h3>

                <div class="lp-editor">
                  <div class="lp-editor-head">
                    <span class="lp-file">alerts.mdx</span>
                    <span class="lp-chip">草稿</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="lp-code">
                    <div class="lp-code-line"><span class="lp-ln">1</span><span class="lp-cm">---</span></div>
                    <div class="lp-code-line"><span class="lp-ln">2</span><span class="lp-key">title:</span> <span class="lp-str">天气预警</span></div>
                    <div class="lp-code-line"><span class="lp-ln">3</span><span class="lp-cm">---</span></div>
                    <div class="lp-code-line"><span class="lp-ln">4</span></div>
                    <div class="lp-code-line"><span class="lp-ln">5</span>每小时天气，任意城市。</div>
                    <div class="lp-code-line"><span class="lp-ln">6</span>见 <span class="lp-link">[配额](/docs/quota)</span>。</div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <ul class="lp-check-list">
                  <li><Icon name="ph:check-circle" class="h-4 w-4" /> 链接可解析</li>
                  <li><Icon name="ph:check-circle" class="h-4 w-4" /> 组件有效</li>
                  <li><Icon name="ph:check-circle" class="h-4 w-4" /> 标题层级正确</li>
                  <li><Icon name="ph:check-circle" class="h-4 w-4" /> 代码块已标注语言</li>
                </ul>

                <p class="lp-stage-foot"><span class="lp-dot lp-dot-green"></span> 4 项检查全部通过</p>
              </article>

              <article class="lp-stage lp-stage-review">
                <p class="lp-stage-label">02 / 评审</p>
                <h3>每一份草稿都等待签核。</h3>

                <div class="lp-review">
                  <div class="lp-review-top">
                    <span class="lp-review-avatars" aria-hidden="true">
                      <span class="lp-avatar lp-avatar-you">你</span>
                      <span class="lp-avatar lp-avatar-agent">AI</span>
                      <span class="lp-avatar lp-avatar-review">S</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="lp-chip lp-chip-warn">等待 Sam</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="lp-review-copy">无论谁写的，内容都要经过同一位评审。</p>
                  <div class="lp-review-action">
                    <span class="lp-button-dark">通过并发布</span>
                    <span class="lp-review-meta">1 份草稿 · 0 条评论</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="lp-quiet-card">
                  <Icon name="ph:seal-check" class="h-5 w-5" />
                  <div>
                    <strong>你的标准，不是建议。</strong>
                    <span>评审通过后，内容才会离开草稿状态。</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p class="lp-stage-foot"><span class="lp-dot"></span> 评审记录随页面保存</p>
              </article>

              <article class="lp-stage lp-stage-ship">
                <p class="lp-stage-label">03 / 发布</p>
                <h3>一次发布，面向两种读者。</h3>

                <ul class="lp-output-list">
                  <li>
                    <Icon name="ph:file-text" class="h-4 w-4" />
                    <span class="lp-output-name">/docs/forecast</span>
                    <span class="lp-output-meta">页面</span>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <Icon name="ph:markdown-logo" class="h-4 w-4" />
                    <span class="lp-output-name">/docs/forecast.md</span>
                    <span class="lp-output-meta">Markdown</span>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <Icon name="ph:list-magnifying-glass" class="h-4 w-4" />
                    <span class="lp-output-name">/llms.txt</span>
                    <span class="lp-output-meta">+1 行</span>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <Icon name="ph:image-square" class="h-4 w-4" />
                    <span class="lp-output-name">/og/forecast.png</span>
                    <span class="lp-output-meta">分享卡片</span>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    <Icon name="ph:tree-structure" class="h-4 w-4" />
                    <span class="lp-output-name">/sitemap.xml</span>
                    <span class="lp-output-meta">+1 URL</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>

                <p class="lp-stage-foot"><span class="lp-dot"></span> HTML 给人，Markdown 给智能体</p>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lp-section lp-audience">
        <div class="lp-container">
          <div class="lp-section-head">
            <p class="lp-kicker">把标准写进流程</p>
            <h2 class="lp-h2">值得读的页面，智能体也能写。</h2>
            <p class="lp-section-sub">你不需要在两套流程之间做选择。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-audience-grid">
            <article class="lp-audience-card">
              <p class="lp-label">01 / 为读者</p>
              <h3>值得读的页面。</h3>
              <ul class="lp-check-list">
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 可交互的图表，读者可以自己探索</li>
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 可复用片段与个性化标签页</li>
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 在你内容原本所在的地方写作</li>
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 预览与生产环境一致</li>
              </ul>

              <div class="lp-mini-doc" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="lp-mini-doc-head">
                  <span class="lp-mini-doc-brand">Sample Co</span>
                  <span class="lp-mini-doc-chip">文档</span>
                </div>
                <p class="lp-mini-doc-title">天气预报</p>
                <p class="lp-mini-doc-line">每小时天气，任意城市。</p>
                <div class="lp-mini-doc-bars">
                  <span style="width: 62%"></span>
                  <span style="width: 84%"></span>
                  <span style="width: 48%"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="lp-mini-doc-tags">
                  <span>客户端</span><span>Worker</span><span>KV</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-audience-card">
              <p class="lp-label">02 / 为智能体</p>
              <h3>智能体能写的页面。</h3>
              <ul class="lp-check-list">
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 智能体可以跟随的写作配方</li>
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 像代码一样被检查、修复的写作错误</li>
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 动手前先了解你的约定</li>
                <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 没有你的签核，任何内容都不会发布</li>
              </ul>

              <div class="lp-mini-code" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="lp-mini-code-head">
                  <span class="lp-file">rate-limits.mdx</span>
                  <span class="lp-chip">智能体草稿</span>
                </div>
                <pre><code><span class="lp-cm">---</span>
<span class="lp-key">title:</span> <span class="lp-str">速率限制</span>
<span class="lp-cm">---</span>

每个 API key 每分钟可以发起
<span class="lp-str">1,000</span> 次请求。

<span class="lp-tagcode">&lt;Diagram of="request-path" /&gt;</span></code></pre>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lp-section lp-theme">
        <div class="lp-container lp-theme-grid">
          <div class="lp-theme-copy">
            <p class="lp-kicker">每个文件都属于你</p>
            <h2 class="lp-h2">让它看起来像你的产品。</h2>
            <p class="lp-section-sub">
              脚手架一次，整个站点就是你的：布局、组件、样式、路由、内容。框架留在下面作为依赖，更新不会碰你的工作。
            </p>

            <ul class="lp-check-list">
              <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 组件以源码落地，不是黑盒</li>
              <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 设计令牌集中在 globals.css</li>
              <li><Icon name="ph:check" class="h-4 w-4" /> 从第一次提交起，文件就是你的</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-theme-panel" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="lp-theme-bar">
              <span>globals.css</span>
              <span class="lp-chip">主题</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="lp-theme-code"><code><span class="lp-theme-line">:root &#123;</span><span class="lp-theme-line">  <span class="lp-key">--nb-brand</span>: oklch(0.373 0.034 260.2);</span><span class="lp-theme-line">  <span class="lp-key">--nb-radius</span>: 0.75rem;</span><span class="lp-theme-line">  <span class="lp-key">--nb-font-sans</span>: "Inter", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;</span><span class="lp-theme-line">&#125;</span></code></pre>
            <div class="lp-swatches">
              <span class="lp-swatch lp-swatch-ink"></span>
              <span class="lp-swatch lp-swatch-brand"></span>
              <span class="lp-swatch lp-swatch-paper"></span>
              <span class="lp-swatch lp-swatch-accent"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-theme-preview">
              <div class="lp-theme-preview-head">
                <Logo class="h-4 w-7" />
                <span>Sample Co</span>
              </div>
              <p>天气预报</p>
              <span class="lp-theme-preview-line"></span>
              <span class="lp-theme-preview-line short"></span>
              <div class="lp-theme-preview-card">
                <strong>每月 1,000 次</strong>
                <span>免费额度 · 随时升级</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="lp-theme-foot">docs.weather.example · 用 Nimbus 搭建</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lp-section lp-features">
        <div class="lp-container">
          <div class="lp-section-head">
            <p class="lp-kicker">功能</p>
            <h2 class="lp-h2">一个文档站需要的一切。</h2>
            <p class="lp-section-sub">内置，或一条命令之遥。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-feature-grid">
            <article class="lp-feature">
              <span class="lp-feature-icon"><Icon name="ph:magnifying-glass" class="h-5 w-5" /></span>
              <h3>AI 搜索</h3>
              <p>向文档提问，得到带来源的答案。</p>
              <span class="lp-feature-foot">内置 Pagefind · 构建时索引</span>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-feature">
              <span class="lp-feature-icon"><Icon name="ph:plugs-connected" class="h-5 w-5" /></span>
              <h3>MCP 服务器</h3>
              <p>把你的文档变成智能体可以调用的工具。</p>
              <span class="lp-feature-foot">一条命令 · list_pages / get_page</span>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-feature">
              <span class="lp-feature-icon"><Icon name="ph:list-checks" class="h-5 w-5" /></span>
              <h3>功能配方</h3>
              <p>智能体按配方把代码写进你的仓库。</p>
              <span class="lp-feature-foot">纯 Markdown · 可审阅</span>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-feature">
              <span class="lp-feature-icon"><Icon name="ph:database" class="h-5 w-5" /></span>
              <h3>内容来源</h3>
              <p>继续在 Notion、Git 或现有仓库里写作。</p>
              <span class="lp-feature-foot">Notion · Git 仓库</span>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-feature">
              <span class="lp-feature-icon"><Icon name="ph:brackets-curly" class="h-5 w-5" /></span>
              <h3>API 参考</h3>
              <p>从 OpenAPI 生成，每个端点都能试用。</p>
              <span class="lp-feature-foot">OpenAPI 3.x · 多版本</span>
            </article>

            <article class="lp-feature">
              <span class="lp-feature-icon"><Icon name="ph:squares-four" class="h-5 w-5" /></span>
              <h3>组件注册表</h3>
              <p>组件以源码落地，功能以配方交付。</p>
              <span class="lp-feature-foot">31 个组件 · 可自由修改</span>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lp-section lp-components">
        <div class="lp-container">
          <div class="lp-section-head lp-section-head-split">
            <div>
              <p class="lp-kicker">需要什么，什么时候需要</p>
              <h2 class="lp-h2">组件不是黑盒。</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="lp-text-link" href="/components/">查看全部组件 <Icon name="ph:arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /></a>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-component-grid">
            <div class="lp-component-card">
              <span class="lp-component-label">src/components/ui/aside/</span>
              <Aside type="note" title="预报每 10 分钟刷新">
                图片、代码、提示框，都是你仓库里的普通文件。
              </Aside>
            </div>

            <div class="lp-component-card">
              <span class="lp-component-label">src/components/ui/steps/</span>
              <Steps>
                <Step title="获取密钥">在控制台创建一个 API key。</Step>
                <Step title="调用接口">向 `/forecast` 发送一次请求。</Step>
              </Steps>
            </div>

            <div class="lp-component-card">
              <span class="lp-component-label">src/components/ui/tabs/</span>
              <Tabs>
                <TabItem label="macOS">按 <kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>K</kbd> 搜索。</TabItem>
                <TabItem label="Windows">按 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>K</kbd> 搜索。</TabItem>
              </Tabs>
            </div>

            <div class="lp-component-card">
              <span class="lp-component-label">src/components/ui/package-managers/</span>
              <PackageManagers pkg="@cloudflare/nimbus-docs" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lp-section lp-faq">
        <div class="lp-container lp-faq-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="lp-kicker">问题</p>
            <h2 class="lp-h2">开始之前。</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-faq-list">
            <details>
              <summary>能直接用在现有的 Markdown 上吗？<Icon name="ph:plus" class="h-4 w-4" /></summary>
              <p>可以。把页面放进 `src/content/docs/`，补上 `title`，剩下的交给检查。缺少的字段和断掉的链接会被指出来。</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>必须使用智能体吗？<Icon name="ph:plus" class="h-4 w-4" /></summary>
              <p>不需要。所有功能都可以手动使用。智能体只是第一等作者，不是必需品。</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>支持哪些智能体？<Icon name="ph:plus" class="h-4 w-4" /></summary>
              <p>任何能读文件的智能体。配方是纯 Markdown，检查结果是 JSON，站点索引是一个固定地址的文本文件。</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>可以部署到哪里？<Icon name="ph:plus" class="h-4 w-4" /></summary>
              <p>任何能提供静态文件的地方。也可以在 Cloudflare、Netlify、Vercel 或 Node 上运行服务器。本站部署在 GitHub Pages。</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>免费吗？<Icon name="ph:plus" class="h-4 w-4" /></summary>
              <p>MIT 许可，没有必须使用的托管服务。组件注册表同样免费。</p>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lp-final">
        <div class="lp-container lp-final-inner">
          <p class="lp-kicker">开始</p>
          <h2 class="lp-final-title">你的文档，五分钟后开始。</h2>
          <p class="lp-section-sub">按 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>C</kbd> 复制命令，或点击按钮。</p>

          <div class="lp-command lp-command-large" data-copy-command data-copy-value={command}>
            <span class="lp-command-prefix">$</span>
            <code class="lp-command-text">{command}</code>
            <button class="lp-command-copy" type="button" data-copy-trigger aria-label="复制安装命令">
              <Icon name="ph:copy" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
              <span data-copy-label>复制</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <p class="lp-note">把它粘贴到终端。几个问题之后，站点就在你的仓库里。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="lp-footer">
      <div class="lp-container">
        <div class="lp-footer-grid">
          <div class="lp-footer-brand">
            <a class="lp-brand" href="/">
              <Logo class="h-6 w-10 shrink-0" />
              <span class="lp-brand-name">Nimbus</span>
            </a>
            <p>面向文档的写作工具。写一次，检查、评审，然后发布给人和智能体。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-footer-col">
            <h3>产品</h3>
            <a href="/quickstart/">快速开始</a>
            <a href="/components/">组件</a>
            <a href="/registry/">注册表</a>
            <a href="/cli/">CLI</a>
          </div>

          <div class="lp-footer-col">
            <h3>文档</h3>
            <a href="/writing/">写作</a>
            <a href="/reference/configuration/">配置</a>
            <a href="/navigation/sidebar/">导航</a>
